LK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1604,"speakerName":"ヘルマン","textMapHash":3058028465,"text":"自分の冒険欲と自尊心に比べて、家族を守ることが今の俺にとって大事なことだ。","nextNodeIds":[200620107]},{"nodeId":200620107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1604,"speakerName":"ヘルマン","textMapHash":3539875313,"text":"でも俺みたいな「冒険者」でも、できることはある。","nextNodeIds":[200620108]},{"nodeId":200620108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1604,"speakerName":"ヘルマン","textMapHash":4198600521,"text":"昔冒険に行った時、ヒルチャールが訓練に使う杭を観察したことがあるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[200620109]},{"nodeId":200620109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1604,"speakerName":"ヘルマン","textMapHash":4064477793,"text":"あの杭はなかなかクオリティが高いし、エリンの訓練にも使えるはずだ。","nextNodeIds":[200620110]},{"nodeId":200620110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1604,"speakerName":"ヘルマン","textMapHash":2802909465,"text":"ヒルチャールの訓練用の杭をいくつか探してきてくれないか？冒険者のルールに従って、ただ働きはさせないさ。どうだ？","nextNodeIds":[200620111,200620112]},{"nodeId":200620111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3356811489,"text":"分かった。","nextNodeIds":[200620113]},{"nodeId":200620113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1604,"speakerName":"ヘルマン","textMapHash":4023177913,"text":"ハハッ、お前みたいなやつは気に入ったよ、冒険者になったばかりの頃の俺と似てる…","nextNodeIds":[200620114]},{"nodeId":200620114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1604,"speakerName":"ヘルマン","textMapHash":3964477369,"text":"冗談だ、気を付けて行ってくれ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":200620112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":480118617,"text":"ヒルチャールくらいなら自分で…","nextNodeIds":[200620115]},{"nodeId":200620115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1604,"speakerName":"ヘルマン","textMapHash":606361481,"text":"だ、だめだ。冒険者の力にも限界がある。一人の冒険者は一つの冒険で精一杯だ。","nextNodeIds":[200620116]},{"nodeId":200620116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1604,"speakerName":"ヘルマン","textMapHash":1079527417,"text":"「結婚生活」という冒険は…どんな偉大な冒険者でも、全力で立ち向かうしかないんだ。","nextNodeIds":[200620117]},{"nodeId":200620117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1604,"speakerName":"ヘルマン","textMapHash":2845355441,"text":"だから、杭を集めるのはお前しか頼めないんだ。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2006201,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_UI","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_START","LNHLPKELCAL":["1604"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":2006202,"order":2,"stepDescription":"魔物の集落を全滅させる","stepDescTextMapHash":281028984,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"13300422101"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["Event_22400_01","20"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[2006204,2006205],"talks":[{"talkId":2006204,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkP